folder=Path(__file__).resolve().parent;root=folder.parents[2];out=root/'test-results/audit-2026-11-05/mouse'
notes={
 'PLAY-017':('spiro-explore36-verification.json','Fresh960×640 paper filled Yellow with Bucket, then Blue3px marker stroke and Purple second ink. Open/close Spiro, return to Brushes and reject an off-paper Orange drag: whole project and PNG remain exact; Red gear retained and ghost cleared. Blue palette remains pressed and second-colour field stays Purple. A deliberate right-click afterward actually paints Purple at300,100; one Undo removes only that dot. No empty gear UI is offered; the specified cancelled-drag alternative is exercised.'),
 'PLAY-018':('spiro-kit36-verification.json','On the preserved mixed artwork, native ring movement shifts centre approximately50×40sourcepixels without changing radius160. Yellow-handle native drag sets209.58833972645564, matching the delivered mouse endpoint mathematically. Actual typing120.5 changes the rendered ring without moving its centre. Independent JPEG circle fits verify initial/moved/resized/exact/Reset geometry within1.5sourcepixels (approximatelyoneCSSpixel); numeric endpoint check is tighter than1e-8. Accepted.5/1e7 limits retain accessible Reset, returning centred640/3 radius. Whole project and PNG artwork stay exact. Broader native fractional typing and bounds are separately verified in LIVE-034.'),
 'PLAY-020':('spiro-focus36-verification.json','After LIVE-035 Stop/Reset/Manual/natural-finish checks and the native motor35 project/PNG round trip, a real6second canvas-key mouse hold is interrupted by raising another window. Stop becomes idle before release; saved partial curve ends at3.796rad rather than333.009rad, with no late completion after release. Whole Undo/Redo exact. Attempting Photo lab during Auto is rejected with Let the current effect finish first, Photo remains collapsed and Stop stays visible. Each new saved curve independently fits its offered-hole geometry; PNG differences stay within that curve. This completes the real interruption/other-workflow alternative alongside synthetic pointercancel/capture-loss coverage. An additional post-focus native reopen attempt could not be completed because of an owned-dialog input tool fault; supported chooser also requires disabled extension file-URL access. That extra reopen is not claimed. Earlier native motor save/reopen remains separately verified.'),
 'PLAY-022':('spiro-mixed36-verification.json','Native-opened exact VECTOR mixed baseline with9pieces: rectangle,line,dog stamp,prior Spiro,transparent partly-off-paper PNG,concave heart,text andtwo independent raster gestures. Added new Blue3px Spiro, selected10.Spiro alone, dragged its gold resize handle by50.0056×30.0007sourcepixels and moved to420,260. Only its transform changes; all9neighbours, original raster bytes, paths, material, IDs and order remain exact. Whole resize/move Undo/Redo exact. Switching to Raster changes only drawingMode, leaving10objects; native project/PNG reopening exact and new Spiro remains individually selectable. Baseline import omits optional wet:false on the two old brush pieces; this exact default normalization is recorded, with every other field and baseline PNG unchanged.')}
ledgerpath=folder/'execution.json';ledger=json.loads(ledgerpath.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig'))
for case in ledger['cases']:
 if case['id'] not in notes:continue
